# lib/gpu_passes.warp's rules that run code at compile time, rule words of extensions/rules/shader_holes.warp: the compiler
# keeps them, taken with the module's own (rewrites.warp module_rule_paths; decision library-zero-bake-plan 1b)
// paint([advect, pressure, show]): the shaders run in list order, each but the last drawing into the field of its name,
// which any of them reads as `$advect(at)`, the latest written earlier in the frame, else last frame's; the last shows
// (wiki/graphics.md "Fields and passes"; `poisson with {which: 1}` a pass with values of its own)
rewrite paint([$items...]) => paint_passes([$passes...], $size...) where $passes = shader_passes($items, $program, $source) and $size = paint_size($program)
